  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The woman is mapped as the victim in the text",
  "description": "The text 'this victimizes me' explicitly maps the woman (the visual entity) as the one being victimized ('me'). The woman's frustrated expression and posture visually represent the state of being victimized as described in the text. This is an analogical mapping where the textual concept of 'me' (the victim) is projected onto the visual entity 'woman'.",
